    <p class="slug"><b>07</b><span>The shit we don’t compromise on</span><span class="ln"></span><span class="m hide-s">Rules</span></p>
    <h2 class="d-l" data-split style="max-width:13ch">The rules we’re not <span class="it">fucking with</span></h2>
    <div class="rules mt-48"><div class="rule" data-reveal><i>01</i><h3>Go > wait</h3><p>If you keep waiting for everyone to be free, you’ll miss everything</p></div><div class="rule" data-reveal><i>02</i><h3>People > plans</h3><p>The itinerary gets you there, the people make you remember it</p></div><div class="rule" data-reveal><i>03</i><h3>No NPC energy</h3><p>No forced networking, no fake community, no pretending everyone is best friends</p></div><div class="rule" data-reveal><i>04</i><h3>Real life > content</h3><p>If the best moment doesn’t make it onto Instagram, good, it was probably better that way</p></div><div class="rule" data-reveal><i>05</i><h3>Take care of your people</h3><p>Wild doesn’t mean careless, we take the boring details seriously so the experience never has to feel boring</p></div><div class="rule" data-reveal><i>06</i><h3>Say yes, then panic</h3><p>Hesitation has never once given anyone a story, the yes comes first, we handle the panic</p></div></div>
